Package: argon-v5-oled
Version: 1.1.0-alpha
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: GamingTux <240287558+GamingTux@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libgpiod3, i2c-tools
Recommends: python3, python3-tk, python3-pil
Description: Lightweight C daemon, CLI & Control Center for Argon ONE V5 OLED (Alpha)
 High-performance, low-memory C driver for the Argon ONE V5 (Raspberry Pi 5)
 SSD1306 128x64 OLED display and GPIO4 hardware button. Features live CPU
 sparkline graphs, NVMe read/write stats, RAM, network bandwidth, digital clock,
 smart burn-in protection, and button interaction.
